WEBVTT

01:27.625 --> 01:28.705
LOVE & CROWN

01:28.785 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL MY QUEEN
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:31.105 --> 01:34.025
EPISODE 24

01:34.745 --> 01:36.465
You don't like me because of her?

01:37.065 --> 01:38.785
That maid has nothing to do with me.

01:40.265 --> 01:41.465
Please give her the antidote.

01:45.945 --> 01:47.265
Then come out of the palace with me.

01:47.345 --> 01:48.545
We'll go fly a kite, okay?

01:51.545 --> 01:52.665
Just this once.

01:53.185 --> 01:54.505
Just this once, please?

01:54.585 --> 01:57.265
Fly the kite with me,
and I'll give you the antidote right away.

01:57.865 --> 01:59.185
I've never lied to you.

03:02.825 --> 03:04.265
Careful!

03:33.025 --> 03:34.545
Your Highness, forgive me.

03:35.625 --> 03:38.145
Li Hongqing, I like you like this.

03:45.105 --> 03:46.185
Here, Your Highness.

03:55.585 --> 03:57.785
The kite string actually cut your hand.

03:58.545 --> 03:59.785
Let's get rid of it!

04:02.945 --> 04:04.385
It's just a little scratch.

04:30.665 --> 04:31.505
What are you doing?

04:31.585 --> 04:33.625
Spit helps with the pain.

04:33.705 --> 04:35.025
An old nanny taught me that.

04:39.345 --> 04:40.705
Are you cold?

04:40.785 --> 04:42.225
Why would I be?

04:42.305 --> 04:43.865
I'm used to it.

04:46.985 --> 04:48.705
I don't want your cloak.

04:51.865 --> 04:53.025
I overstepped.

05:07.385 --> 05:08.465
Your Highness…

05:19.105 --> 05:21.625
Why is your heart beating so fast?

05:30.545 --> 05:32.265
Are you ill?

05:36.185 --> 05:37.145
No…

05:37.665 --> 05:39.785
I'm… perfectly fine.

05:40.385 --> 05:43.025
Then… why are you stuttering?

05:44.985 --> 05:45.905
I…

05:55.105 --> 05:56.505
I'm hungry.

05:58.665 --> 05:59.865
Then…

06:01.105 --> 06:02.385
I'll take you to get something to eat.

06:16.425 --> 06:18.305
Miss, you're so pretty!

06:41.225 --> 06:43.985
Just you wait!
I'll call my brother to beat you up!

06:44.065 --> 06:45.305
He can't beat me.

06:55.345 --> 06:56.625
Kid,

06:56.705 --> 06:58.345
how about we buy your tanghulu?
(*candied hawthorn)

06:59.105 --> 07:02.385
I don't want money!
I just want the tanghulu!

07:13.985 --> 07:15.145
It's so good.

07:16.585 --> 07:17.465
You just wait!

07:17.545 --> 07:19.665
Don't you run! I'll get my brother!

07:19.745 --> 07:20.825
If you've got guts, don't run!

07:31.545 --> 07:33.625
Your Highness, let's go.

07:34.625 --> 07:36.705
He told me to wait here. I can't leave.

07:39.785 --> 07:41.505
When he comes back with his brother,

07:41.585 --> 07:42.785
you can help me
knock his brother's teeth out.

07:49.625 --> 07:51.385
Are you upset again?

08:10.145 --> 08:11.545
Did I do something wrong?

08:15.185 --> 08:16.225
Your Highness,

08:17.065 --> 08:18.745
you can't snatch tanghulu from a child.

08:18.825 --> 08:20.385
I'm a princess.

08:20.465 --> 08:22.305
If I want to eat it, why can't I?

08:24.225 --> 08:25.785
And that maid.

08:25.865 --> 08:27.425
I was never going to accept
her sachet anyway.

08:28.345 --> 08:30.745
She didn't do anything wrong.
Why should she have to die for it?

08:30.825 --> 08:32.385
You really wouldn't have taken it?

08:33.465 --> 08:34.985
That's not the point.

08:36.585 --> 08:37.865
I just don't like her.

08:46.865 --> 08:48.945
If that makes you unhappy,

08:49.025 --> 08:50.425
then maybe I can like her too.

08:53.825 --> 08:54.905
Does it have anything

08:56.865 --> 08:58.305
to do with whether I'm happy?

08:58.385 --> 08:59.905
Of course it does.

09:00.825 --> 09:02.945
I like you. I just want you to be happy.

09:05.705 --> 09:07.025
Then do you like me?

09:12.505 --> 09:13.505
What if I don't?

09:16.145 --> 09:17.265
Would you tell me to die too?

09:24.145 --> 09:25.265
I wouldn't.

09:25.905 --> 09:27.265
Commander Li can't die.

09:27.865 --> 09:30.385
If you died, I'd be really sad.

09:31.825 --> 09:34.065
Sadder than if I died myself.

09:46.265 --> 09:49.785
When Your Highness knows what's right

09:50.625 --> 09:52.065
and what's wrong,

09:53.385 --> 09:54.305
you're actually very lovable.

09:58.145 --> 09:59.705
Your Highness, where are you going?

09:59.785 --> 10:01.465
To buy tanghulu!

10:01.545 --> 10:03.145
He just said…

10:05.825 --> 10:07.745
he only wants the tanghulu,

10:07.825 --> 10:09.545
not the money!

10:16.985 --> 10:20.585
LINGHE HALL

10:40.145 --> 10:41.825
Xiao Huan, you're awake.

10:43.225 --> 10:45.025
Cangcang, you're awake too.

10:45.105 --> 10:46.505
Princess Ying?

10:50.705 --> 10:52.145
My greetings to you both.

10:54.465 --> 10:55.985
-What's this about?
-What are you doing here?

10:58.825 --> 11:00.745
I'm here to ask you for a favor.

11:01.905 --> 11:03.305
What is it?

11:03.385 --> 11:04.985
Commander Li said

11:05.065 --> 11:09.065
he has to ask you
if he's allowed to like me.

11:13.065 --> 11:14.465
You have to say yes.

11:15.065 --> 11:17.825
A dignified, gracious,
broad-minded princess

11:17.905 --> 11:19.825
should come find me
at Wuying Hall tomorrow,

11:19.905 --> 11:23.305
not barge into Linghe Hall at night
and disturb my sleep.

11:24.625 --> 11:26.065
If I have to wait till tomorrow,

11:26.985 --> 11:29.065
I might just die from it.

11:29.905 --> 11:32.145
Don't worry. I'll think it over.

11:32.225 --> 11:34.105
Not "think it over."

11:34.185 --> 11:35.825
You have to agree!

11:37.345 --> 11:38.425
All right.

11:38.505 --> 11:39.665
I understand.

11:40.385 --> 11:41.465
Go back and get some sleep.

11:42.265 --> 11:43.105
Yes!

11:46.225 --> 11:48.065
Then I'll take my leave.

12:05.745 --> 12:08.945
I used to hit you and yell at you.

12:09.025 --> 12:11.585
I even poisoned you. That was my fault.

12:13.665 --> 12:15.025
So I'm here to apologize.

12:24.745 --> 12:25.825
You're all forgiving me?

12:26.745 --> 12:28.105
-We do!
-We do!

12:28.185 --> 12:30.625
-We do!
-We do!

12:30.705 --> 12:32.505
-Ying.
-Qianqing!

12:35.465 --> 12:36.865
What's going on with them?

12:36.945 --> 12:38.345
I'm apologizing to them.

12:38.425 --> 12:40.185
They're all happily forgiving me.

12:40.785 --> 12:41.745
They're happy?

12:42.505 --> 12:44.745
-Happy!
-Happy!

12:44.825 --> 12:45.905
-So happy!
-So happy!

12:45.985 --> 12:48.225
See? They're really happy.

12:53.345 --> 12:54.505
The sky's clear now.

12:54.585 --> 12:56.585
Qianqing, come sit in the sun with me!

12:57.825 --> 12:58.865
Come on.

13:10.185 --> 13:13.385
Qianqing, what is filial piety?

13:14.145 --> 13:16.705
Is it just doing what you're told,

13:17.225 --> 13:18.625
and being there at the very end?

13:20.825 --> 13:21.905
More or less.

13:24.625 --> 13:25.665
Qianqing,

13:26.185 --> 13:28.065
I'll definitely be there for you
in the end.

13:35.865 --> 13:37.505
I won't try to kill His Majesty anymore.

13:39.225 --> 13:40.425
Brother Hongqing said

13:41.065 --> 13:43.185
when Luling Palace was on fire,

13:43.705 --> 13:46.785
His Majesty was still very young
and in poor health,

13:46.865 --> 13:48.745
so it wasn't on purpose
that he didn't save me.

13:50.305 --> 13:51.465
So I can't blame him.

13:52.545 --> 13:53.865
Well, well.

13:54.385 --> 13:56.745
So now you've got
a Brother Hongqing besides me.

13:59.025 --> 14:00.065
Qianqing…

14:01.705 --> 14:03.465
let me tell you a secret.

14:04.105 --> 14:05.145
Go on.

14:06.345 --> 14:09.225
Yesterday, he took me out to have fun.

14:11.905 --> 14:13.585
He told me lots of things.

14:14.465 --> 14:15.585
He said

14:16.745 --> 14:18.625
he kind of likes me.

14:19.665 --> 14:23.145
If I can be a bit more proper,
he'll like me even more.

14:23.225 --> 14:25.105
So I stayed up all night
memorizing two books.

14:25.185 --> 14:26.025
I'll recite them for you, okay?

14:26.945 --> 14:28.065
Okay.

14:31.745 --> 14:34.745
"A gentleman
does not seek fullness in food

14:34.825 --> 14:36.185
or comfort in living.

14:36.905 --> 14:39.585
He is diligent in action,
cautious in speech,

14:40.425 --> 14:43.145
and learns from the virtuous
to correct himself.

14:43.905 --> 14:45.425
This is…

14:46.545 --> 14:49.065
what it means to love learning."

14:49.145 --> 14:52.145
What you memorized overnight
is the Analects of Confucius.

14:52.225 --> 14:54.705
-And you…
-Don't interrupt me, or I'll forget it!

14:54.785 --> 14:56.145
All right.

14:56.705 --> 15:02.105
"A gentleman
can shoulder great responsibilities…"

15:15.025 --> 15:16.145
Later,

15:17.145 --> 15:19.705
when Hongqing comes,

15:20.545 --> 15:22.065
remember to wake me up.

15:22.865 --> 15:23.865
Don't worry.

15:24.385 --> 15:25.585
I promise.

15:29.425 --> 15:30.985
You have grown up

15:31.865 --> 15:34.185
and finally found your own happiness.

15:35.505 --> 15:36.985
I'm happy for you.

15:38.385 --> 15:39.465
That's wonderful.

15:42.265 --> 15:43.465
Qianqing…

15:45.985 --> 15:49.265
I'll be there for you in the end.

15:50.425 --> 15:51.465
All right.

15:52.385 --> 15:55.345
I'll be waiting for you to see me off.

16:11.825 --> 16:13.905
Court's off today and the weather's good.

16:14.505 --> 16:16.105
It's nice to come out for some fresh air.

16:16.185 --> 16:18.385
What a shame
this outfit isn't good for archery.

16:18.465 --> 16:20.625
Or we'd show those two up in archery.

16:21.745 --> 16:25.425
Your Majesty,
let's settle it at the range today.

16:25.505 --> 16:27.065
If you lose, don't be a sore loser.

16:27.145 --> 16:28.905
You still talk too much.

16:38.705 --> 16:39.865
This is so sour.

16:39.945 --> 16:41.065
How can you eat this?

16:41.625 --> 16:43.985
I don't think so.
It's really refreshing. Tastes great.

16:52.985 --> 16:54.705
You're flirting right in front of us?

17:24.065 --> 17:26.025
Which of them do you think will win?

17:27.545 --> 17:29.345
I bet His Majesty will win!

18:08.905 --> 18:11.145
Good!

18:11.665 --> 18:12.985
That one doesn't count!

18:13.065 --> 18:14.385
I just slipped up.
This round doesn't count.

18:15.625 --> 18:17.905
You're still just like before,
can't stand losing.

18:17.985 --> 18:19.465
Who's a sore loser?

18:19.545 --> 18:20.865
You only won once.

18:20.945 --> 18:21.945
If you've got guts, let's go again.

18:22.025 --> 18:24.505
Maybe I'll go easy on you

18:24.585 --> 18:25.865
and let you win one.

18:25.945 --> 18:27.145
I don't need that.

18:28.185 --> 18:30.265
Congratulations on your victory.

18:30.345 --> 18:31.905
Your Majesty is truly impressive.

18:35.705 --> 18:36.825
Feng Wufu!

18:37.985 --> 18:39.305
You're such a suck-up!

18:40.185 --> 18:42.505
Your Highness, he just outmatches you.

18:42.585 --> 18:44.745
Don't take it out on me, please.

18:48.625 --> 18:50.305
This dagger cuts iron like it's nothing,

18:50.905 --> 18:52.305
a rare treasure in this world.

18:54.065 --> 18:55.425
Thank you.

18:57.585 --> 18:59.225
What are you grinning at?

19:01.745 --> 19:02.745
Sit down.

19:03.785 --> 19:05.505
They're being all lovey-dovey.

19:05.585 --> 19:06.985
What's so great about watching them?

19:07.065 --> 19:08.265
You're only allowed to look at me.

19:09.665 --> 19:11.985
All right. I'll only look at you.

19:12.065 --> 19:13.745
Your Highness
is the cutest man in the world,

19:13.825 --> 19:15.425
the most handsome, and the most fun.

19:15.505 --> 19:16.825
You're the only one
in my heart and in my eyes.

19:16.905 --> 19:18.025
Satisfied now?

19:42.065 --> 19:43.345
Your Majesty really hides
your talents well.

19:43.425 --> 19:45.105
You roast meat

19:45.185 --> 19:47.825
as well as any master cook
in the martial world.

19:48.985 --> 19:50.305
That's because when he was little,

19:50.385 --> 19:51.865
he went through too much hardship.

19:54.265 --> 19:56.425
It's all in the past.
No need to bring it up.

19:59.345 --> 20:00.425
Here.

20:04.625 --> 20:05.665
Smells amazing!

20:08.465 --> 20:09.745
Zhong Lin, have a taste.

20:14.585 --> 20:16.665
Delicious! So good!

20:18.305 --> 20:20.385
My grilled fish is just as carefully made.

20:20.985 --> 20:22.145
Don't play favorites, okay?

20:22.905 --> 20:24.625
Zhong Lin, here. Have a taste.

20:28.065 --> 20:29.185
Cangcang, after you.

20:43.505 --> 20:44.425
What's wrong, Cangcang?

20:47.105 --> 20:48.425
Nothing.

20:48.505 --> 20:49.985
Maybe today's fish…

20:51.225 --> 20:52.545
is a bit fishy.

20:56.345 --> 20:57.425
Let me smell.

21:03.305 --> 21:04.345
It doesn't smell fishy.

21:05.225 --> 21:06.705
You usually love fish the most.

21:06.785 --> 21:08.985
Why the change in taste today?

21:09.065 --> 21:12.065
No way.
The fish I grilled could never be fishy.

21:24.465 --> 21:25.705
I told you, I'm fine.

21:25.785 --> 21:27.105
Don't get so worked up.

21:27.745 --> 21:32.385
You couple
should really let me worry less!

21:45.745 --> 21:46.745
Physician Li,

21:47.385 --> 21:49.625
is there something wrong with her health?

21:57.585 --> 21:58.585
Your Majesty…

22:00.345 --> 22:03.985
you'd better get ready.

22:08.945 --> 22:10.185
Get ready?

22:11.185 --> 22:12.185
Get ready for what?

22:20.105 --> 22:22.785
Her Majesty is carrying your child!

22:22.865 --> 22:25.145
Get ready to be a father.

22:31.465 --> 22:35.145
So you mean she is pregnant?

22:36.065 --> 22:37.545
Congratulations, Your Majesty!

22:38.145 --> 22:39.225
-Congratulations, Your Majesty!
-Congratulations, Your Majesty.

22:39.305 --> 22:42.425
-Congratulations, Her Majesty!
-Congratulations, Her Majesty.

22:43.585 --> 22:47.105
Although in the past,
Her Majesty's health took some damage,

22:47.185 --> 22:49.985
thankfully her constitution
is still very strong,

22:50.065 --> 22:52.585
and so is yours.

22:53.265 --> 22:56.825
In a moment, I'll prescribe some medicine
to protect the baby.

22:56.905 --> 22:59.465
You must take it regularly

22:59.985 --> 23:02.825
and must not overwork yourself again.

23:02.905 --> 23:07.065
You two really are trying
to smash my good reputation, aren't you?

23:09.545 --> 23:10.385
Physician Li,

23:10.985 --> 23:12.705
for these next ten months,

23:12.785 --> 23:14.865
I hope you can stay here in the Capital.

23:14.945 --> 23:16.065
You brat,

23:16.145 --> 23:18.785
now you want to chain me here?

23:18.865 --> 23:19.945
Fine.

23:20.025 --> 23:23.185
From now on, your married life
is my responsibility.

23:26.785 --> 23:28.025
What are you all standing around for?

23:28.105 --> 23:29.305
Get out!

23:34.625 --> 23:35.545
Thank you, Physician Li.

23:49.145 --> 23:49.985
Cangcang,

23:51.345 --> 23:52.585
thank you.

24:18.745 --> 24:20.145
I heard you went to Wuying Hall.

24:20.985 --> 24:22.465
Did His Majesty make things hard for you?

24:23.345 --> 24:24.185
No.

24:25.865 --> 24:27.745
I showed him most of my sincerity.

24:28.665 --> 24:30.865
Even with all the resentment in his heart,

24:31.745 --> 24:33.665
we've helped each other after all.

24:35.145 --> 24:37.905
I figured he'd remember that bond

24:40.105 --> 24:41.545
and show me some mercy.

24:46.305 --> 24:48.945
Even if there's trust,
it's not like before.

24:49.025 --> 24:51.025
It doesn't have to be!

24:53.665 --> 24:54.825
In his eyes,

24:56.505 --> 24:57.465
I never mattered much.

25:03.585 --> 25:04.665
That's true.

25:23.945 --> 25:25.105
I know you really

25:27.025 --> 25:28.985
have my best interests at heart.

25:32.305 --> 25:35.025
Madam, you don't have to force yourself.

25:36.585 --> 25:38.185
I know you're unhappy today.

25:38.865 --> 25:40.785
Why would I be unhappy?

25:42.705 --> 25:44.265
His Majesty…

25:44.345 --> 25:46.265
finally has an heir.

25:46.345 --> 25:48.585
We should be happy for him!

25:50.105 --> 25:53.465
We should be celebrating!

25:55.345 --> 25:56.745
I just don't understand

25:56.825 --> 25:59.785
how the Xiao family can live so happily
after ruining my mother!

26:05.585 --> 26:07.625
It's not fair!

26:23.385 --> 26:26.265
Do you like children?

26:36.705 --> 26:38.665
Or only the one

26:39.945 --> 26:41.905
she'll give you?

26:54.745 --> 26:56.065
LINGHE HALL

27:11.825 --> 27:13.265
Your Majesty,

27:13.345 --> 27:15.225
forgive me for the offense.

27:15.305 --> 27:16.465
Search the place!

28:04.905 --> 28:05.945
Cangcang,

28:06.585 --> 28:08.585
can you explain what all this is?

28:10.105 --> 28:12.465
Why can't you keep the promises
you made to me?

28:13.345 --> 28:14.825
I was just reading them.

28:15.505 --> 28:16.905
I didn't mean anything else.

28:17.465 --> 28:20.225
Besides, those street tales,

28:20.305 --> 28:23.345
sometimes, they're…

28:24.225 --> 28:25.345
not as thrilling as ghost stories.

28:27.745 --> 28:28.585
Isn't martial arts enough?

28:29.185 --> 28:30.985
No. Not exciting enough.

28:43.865 --> 28:46.145
Don't be mad.

28:48.825 --> 28:49.905
Mr. Bai.

28:50.905 --> 28:51.905
Dear Bai.

28:56.465 --> 28:57.705
Mr. Bai.

28:57.785 --> 28:59.345
Dear Bai.

28:59.425 --> 29:00.425
That won't work on me.

29:01.025 --> 29:02.145
No, really…

29:02.225 --> 29:04.185
they're actually quite good.

29:06.065 --> 29:07.745
Let me show you.

29:09.945 --> 29:10.905
Just read this one.

29:12.145 --> 29:14.745
It's the story of Swallow Eight.

29:14.825 --> 29:16.425
She can catch demons,

29:16.505 --> 29:17.985
but she's actually a demon herself.

29:18.705 --> 29:21.345
Later she's killed for drinking too much,

29:21.425 --> 29:22.625
then she turns into a woman

29:23.225 --> 29:24.785
and falls for the man who killed her.

29:30.945 --> 29:32.105
And this one.

29:32.985 --> 29:33.905
It's really good too.

29:35.025 --> 29:37.985
Let me show you.
This one is about a male ghost.

29:38.065 --> 29:41.945
He always puts a robe
over the woman he loves

29:42.025 --> 29:43.465
after she falls asleep.

29:44.145 --> 29:45.825
It's actually a very heartwarming story.

29:48.905 --> 29:50.665
Really! If you don't believe me,

29:51.705 --> 29:53.945
you can ask Eunuch Feng.

29:56.145 --> 29:57.225
Right?

30:01.065 --> 30:02.145
Yes…

30:02.745 --> 30:06.225
Ever since Her Majesty
first told me that story,

30:06.305 --> 30:08.265
I've been full of energy when helping you

30:08.345 --> 30:11.065
with memorials, not sleepy at all.

30:19.425 --> 30:22.065
And there are even more stories like that.

30:22.145 --> 30:23.225
All right, Cangcang.

30:23.305 --> 30:25.425
Earlier,
I've specially looked up some classics.

30:26.505 --> 30:29.385
The mother of King Wen of Zhou
never looked at anything improper

30:29.465 --> 30:32.625
or listened to anything unpleasant
when she was pregnant.

30:32.705 --> 30:34.145
That's what they call prenatal education.

30:35.385 --> 30:36.545
Prenatal education?

30:38.105 --> 30:39.945
-So…
-So,

30:40.025 --> 30:42.345
I've specially picked out this book,

30:42.985 --> 30:46.785
Tales of Rivers and Mountains,
full of travel notes and insights.

30:46.865 --> 30:48.025
You can read it properly.

30:50.105 --> 30:51.785
Come on, sit back down.

31:02.305 --> 31:03.385
Wufu.

31:08.465 --> 31:09.465
Here.

31:16.745 --> 31:18.225
So many words,

31:18.745 --> 31:20.145
packed so tightly.

31:20.225 --> 31:20.905
TALES OF RIVERS AND MOUNTAINS

31:20.985 --> 31:22.465
How am I supposed to get through this?

31:24.065 --> 31:25.265
It's all right.

31:25.345 --> 31:27.785
I can read it to you slowly.

31:32.745 --> 31:35.705
Once we're done, you have to eat properly.

31:36.545 --> 31:37.865
What would you like to eat?

31:40.705 --> 31:41.545
I…

31:41.625 --> 31:42.905
Five-spice crispy fish.

31:48.985 --> 31:50.065
No.

31:50.585 --> 31:51.825
Smells fishy.

31:53.545 --> 31:54.625
Next.

31:58.585 --> 32:00.585
Crystal mutton jelly.

32:06.385 --> 32:07.465
Next.

32:08.265 --> 32:09.705
Stuffed eight-treasure duck.

32:16.065 --> 32:17.705
You don't even want that?

32:18.865 --> 32:20.745
No. I'm not hungry.

32:21.625 --> 32:24.545
Maybe… just don't serve anything.

32:25.265 --> 32:27.145
Since she has no appetite,
take it all away.

32:27.225 --> 32:30.065
Out of the palace,
I ran around so many restaurants for you.

32:30.145 --> 32:31.025
My legs nearly broke.

32:31.105 --> 32:32.905
And she doesn't even want a single dish!

32:33.505 --> 32:35.065
My reputation's already taken a hit,

32:35.825 --> 32:38.025
and you clear everything away
and won't even let me eat?

32:38.105 --> 32:41.385
She can't handle anything greasy.

32:42.145 --> 32:43.825
-Take it all away.
-What a waste.

32:44.705 --> 32:46.865
Pack it all up and take it to my manor.

32:46.945 --> 32:49.465
-I'll share it with Zhong Lin.
-Okay.

32:58.265 --> 32:59.505
What are you thinking about?

32:59.585 --> 33:02.705
I was thinking
spring will be here in a few days.

33:03.385 --> 33:04.545
Yes.

33:04.625 --> 33:07.065
I've already approved
this year's court assembly.

33:08.625 --> 33:10.065
So much has happened lately.

33:10.905 --> 33:14.545
My father
should have been here by my side,

33:15.665 --> 33:16.665
but now…

33:19.585 --> 33:22.225
Cangcang, you still have me,

33:22.305 --> 33:24.385
Zhong Lin, Xiao Qianqing,

33:24.465 --> 33:26.185
and the child we'll have in the future.

33:26.705 --> 33:29.585
If you miss your father,
you can visit him.

33:30.265 --> 33:33.465
If he knows we are having a child,

33:33.985 --> 33:34.865
what will he think?

33:47.825 --> 33:49.465
DEER COURTYARD

34:08.344 --> 34:10.545
When you break through the earth,

34:12.185 --> 34:14.744
it will be time for great deeds.

34:23.585 --> 34:25.264
LINGHE HALL

34:25.344 --> 34:26.425
Your Majesty.

34:26.505 --> 34:29.545
His Majesty had the kitchens
prepare this bird's nest soup.

34:29.625 --> 34:32.065
He told me to make sure you taste it.

34:57.465 --> 34:58.625
Eunuch Feng?

34:58.705 --> 35:00.465
Peace to Your Majesty.

35:01.825 --> 35:03.105
What brings you here?

35:03.185 --> 35:04.185
Where is His Majesty?

35:04.265 --> 35:07.785
Your Majesty,
His Majesty is busy in Wuying Hall.

35:07.865 --> 35:11.065
He sent me
to change out Your Majesty's incense.

35:11.665 --> 35:12.585
Change the incense?

35:13.745 --> 35:16.105
The one I have is perfectly fine.
Why change it?

35:16.185 --> 35:17.945
His Majesty said

35:18.465 --> 35:23.025
the old incense was for clearing the head
and wasn't the best for you now.

35:23.705 --> 35:26.345
So he wants this gentler blend instead,

35:26.425 --> 35:29.785
to keep Your Majesty relaxed every day.

35:31.105 --> 35:31.985
Very well.

35:34.825 --> 35:36.025
All right.

35:38.785 --> 35:40.945
Xiaoshan, go bring me my sword.

35:41.025 --> 35:41.865
I'm in the mood today.

35:42.785 --> 35:43.865
No!

35:43.945 --> 35:47.585
Your Majesty, you're not well right now.

35:47.665 --> 35:48.945
You mustn't practice swordplay.

35:49.025 --> 35:49.865
I can't do this either?

35:54.705 --> 35:57.385
I was once
the proud leader of Fenglai Pavilion,

35:57.465 --> 36:00.265
and now
I've become some pampered hothouse flower?

36:01.825 --> 36:02.945
Forget it.

36:03.905 --> 36:04.825
Your Majesty, where are you going?

36:04.905 --> 36:06.425
His Majesty said you mustn't run around.

36:08.185 --> 36:09.745
I'm going to find him, all right?

36:12.585 --> 36:13.665
Your Majesty…

36:20.585 --> 36:21.665
Your Majesty.

36:23.865 --> 36:25.065
Cangcang!

36:30.465 --> 36:31.305
What brings you here?

36:31.905 --> 36:32.905
I'm here to take you back.

36:33.785 --> 36:35.745
Xiaoshan watches me all day,

36:35.825 --> 36:39.065
saying you told her I can't do this
and I can't do that.

36:39.585 --> 36:41.345
I'm about to turn into a complete invalid.

36:43.785 --> 36:45.625
I wouldn't even mind being useless,

36:45.705 --> 36:46.585
but…

36:47.105 --> 36:49.065
could you at least
not take away my freedom?

36:50.945 --> 36:53.505
Cangcang, it's all for your own good.

36:54.225 --> 36:55.665
Once Physician Li says
you can move around,

36:55.745 --> 36:56.745
you'll have more freedom.

36:58.865 --> 36:59.985
All right.

37:01.105 --> 37:03.145
Then until Physician Li nods,

37:03.825 --> 37:06.025
I promise I'll behave myself.

37:07.025 --> 37:08.665
-Good.
-Come on.

37:08.745 --> 37:09.585
Let's go back to Linghe Hall.

37:10.265 --> 37:11.305
Let's go.

37:21.545 --> 37:23.225
-Wufu.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

37:23.305 --> 37:25.585
Double-check everything
the Empress eats or uses.

37:25.665 --> 37:26.665
No errors are allowed.

37:26.745 --> 37:27.865
Understood.

37:29.665 --> 37:31.385
You'll personally keep watch over
the guards at Linghe Hall.

37:31.465 --> 37:32.385
Understood.

37:34.065 --> 37:35.065
Your Majesty,

37:35.705 --> 37:37.025
isn't this a bit much?

37:44.865 --> 37:45.745
But don't worry.

37:45.825 --> 37:47.705
I'll keep an eye on my mother.

37:47.785 --> 37:50.025
We'll see your heir safely born.

37:51.105 --> 37:52.385
All right.

37:53.425 --> 37:54.825
How are things at Deer Courtyard?

37:55.345 --> 37:56.625
Your father-in-law
works the fields there every day.

37:56.705 --> 37:58.065
He caught a slight chill recently
and has been coughing.

37:58.745 --> 38:00.065
The imperial physicians have seen him.

38:00.145 --> 38:01.465
Aside from that, nothing unusual.

38:02.745 --> 38:04.385
Make sure he's well taken care of.

38:04.465 --> 38:06.825
After all, he's getting old.

38:07.505 --> 38:08.625
Understood.

38:09.425 --> 38:11.385
Add some coltsfoot blossoms.

38:11.905 --> 38:13.865
They're very good for easing the cough.

38:17.745 --> 38:18.745
Here, Madam.

38:28.745 --> 38:30.025
"Shi Yan will launch a surprise attack

38:30.105 --> 38:33.185
on Lingbi Sect's Langye Mountain branch
in two days."

38:36.905 --> 38:38.705
Leak this news to Lingbi Sect.

38:41.105 --> 38:42.825
But won't that put Shi Yan in danger?

38:42.905 --> 38:45.025
If something happens to Shi Yan,

38:45.105 --> 38:46.505
what will Li Hongqing do?

38:48.985 --> 38:50.905
With the commander
of the Imperial Guards away,

38:52.105 --> 38:55.505
you, the deputy commander,
can serve a greater purpose.

39:00.905 --> 39:02.065
Understood.

39:02.145 --> 39:04.105
That mad princess in the palace

39:04.185 --> 39:08.225
is still
a clever move we haven't even played.

39:34.745 --> 39:35.825
Saintess.

39:35.905 --> 39:37.185
I have received word

39:37.265 --> 39:38.385
that the Emperor's Xiaoxing Guards

39:38.465 --> 39:40.545
plans to strike
Lingbi Sect's Langye Mountain branch.

39:48.785 --> 39:50.705
SAINTESS, LINGBI SECT

39:57.025 --> 39:58.625
Is the report accurate?

39:59.185 --> 40:00.065
Yes.

40:00.585 --> 40:02.665
Shi Yan meant to strike straight
at the heart

40:02.745 --> 40:05.185
and take the Langye Mountain branch
in one blow.

40:05.265 --> 40:06.665
But he walked into an ambush.

40:08.345 --> 40:09.825
Though the Ghost King is dead

40:10.345 --> 40:11.865
and they're now headless,

40:11.945 --> 40:14.065
they've been
in the martial world for years

40:14.145 --> 40:15.465
and are hard to wipe out completely.

40:16.065 --> 40:18.305
Earlier, Zhu Sha mentioned the Saintess,

40:18.385 --> 40:19.425
saying she's their true master.

40:21.385 --> 40:24.025
I request permission to set out
to bring Shi Yan back

40:24.105 --> 40:25.865
and uncover the truth for Your Majesty.

40:27.265 --> 40:29.225
All right. Then be careful.

40:36.825 --> 40:37.945
Commander Li.

40:42.305 --> 40:43.385
What did you need from me?

40:43.465 --> 40:44.505
I'm leaving on urgent business.

40:44.585 --> 40:46.465
The palace patrols
and His Majesty's safety

40:46.545 --> 40:48.305
-will be in your hands.
-We're buddies.

40:48.385 --> 40:49.505
No need to be so formal.

40:50.025 --> 40:52.785
Besides, this is all part of my duty.

40:53.865 --> 40:56.025
Also, over at the cold palace,

40:56.105 --> 40:57.625
no more than three lamps are allowed.

40:57.705 --> 40:58.665
All lamps must be out by the hour of Xu.

40:59.345 --> 41:00.385
Though that's the servants' task,

41:00.465 --> 41:02.185
have the men keep an eye on it too.

41:02.265 --> 41:03.625
Ask them to help watch it.

41:04.785 --> 41:06.985
Three lamps. Hour of Xu. No problem.

41:07.945 --> 41:09.625
-Thank you.
-Oh, yes.

41:10.545 --> 41:13.185
You know what the princess is like.

41:13.265 --> 41:15.225
I'm afraid the guys won't handle her well

41:15.305 --> 41:16.785
and make her unhappy.

41:17.505 --> 41:18.625
It's fine.

41:19.145 --> 41:20.105
Just coax her and say

41:20.945 --> 41:23.385
as long as she doesn't get mad
or hit anyone,

41:24.025 --> 41:25.465
the flower will bloom soon.

42:05.785 --> 42:07.185
What kind of flower is it?

42:09.265 --> 42:10.985
Honestly, I'm not quite sure.

42:11.745 --> 42:13.825
But once it blooms, we'll know.

42:19.505 --> 42:20.865
I'll take good care of it.

42:20.945 --> 42:25.385
I'll make sure
it grows up well and blossoms.

42:25.905 --> 42:27.705
Then we can see
what it looks like together.

42:47.665 --> 42:50.185
I'm not eating until Hongqing comes back.

42:50.785 --> 42:51.825
Your Highness,

42:51.905 --> 42:53.625
Commander Li will be gone
for quite a few days.

42:53.705 --> 42:55.425
You'll ruin your health if you starve.

42:55.505 --> 42:56.585
We can't have that.

43:00.385 --> 43:01.825
All right then.

43:01.905 --> 43:03.705
I should be more understanding.

43:05.745 --> 43:09.185
Then, I'll eat ten bites today,

43:09.265 --> 43:10.905
nine bites tomorrow…

43:11.785 --> 43:13.825
If he still isn't back in ten days,

43:14.625 --> 43:15.625
I won't eat a single bite!

43:16.865 --> 43:17.705
Your Highness,

43:17.785 --> 43:20.065
this… this absolutely won't do!

43:20.145 --> 43:21.385
Let me talk to Her Highness.

43:25.945 --> 43:26.785
Get out.

43:29.185 --> 43:30.145
I don't like you.
